    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "挂起（Suspend）",
      "items": [
        "step 内调 suspend()，run 状态写为 suspended",
        "快照（含 resume 数据）持久化到 workflows store",
        "服务器重启后，running 快照若含挂起 step 会回退为 suspended（/agents/:id/recover 恢复）",
        "GET /suspended-runs 列出挂起的 run，重启后仍可见"
      ]
    },
